# Composer
# NOTE: composer.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here — this repo commits
# it by S440 law (178603f; tests/SecurityAuditCheckTest.php's
# testTheCommittedLockExists asserts it, and the whole audit gate is built
# on the pinned lock). The reference skeleton's ignore line is the known
# family contradiction: it would make future legitimate lock updates
# unstageable without -f. Kept out on purpose, not an oversight.

# Git (rarely needed in plugin, but standard)
# .git/
# .gitignore is tracked
